      "ai_full_markdown": "# AI 综合回答：三种上座\n\n## 直接回答\n三种上座是：出生（年长）上座、法上座、世俗上座 [1][2]。\n\n## 要点展开\n### 三种上座的定义\n- 出生（年长）上座：指因年龄或出生而成为上座 [1][2]。\n- 法上座：指因通达佛法而成为上座 [1][2]。\n- 世俗上座：指因世俗身份或地位而成为上座 [1][2]。\n\n## 证据覆盖情况\n现有证据仅明确列出了三种上座的名称，未对每种上座的具体定义或区别展开说明。\n\n## 引用\n- [1] Early Buddhist · DN33 · 三种上座 · source — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=dn33&lang=zh&q=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A8_dn&mt=%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%88%E5%B9%B4%E9%95%B7%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%97%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%82\n  > 三种上座：出生（年长）上座、法上座、世俗上座。\n- [2] Early Buddhist · 经藏/长部_dn · dn33 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=dn33&lang=zh&q=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A8_dn&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%88%E5%B9%B4%E9%95%B7%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%81%E4%B8%96%E4%BF%97%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E3%80%82\n  > 三种上座：出生（年长）上座、法上座、世俗上座。\n- [3] Early Buddhist · 经藏/增支部_an · an5.88 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=an5.88&lang=zh&q=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E5%A2%9E%E6%94%AF%E9%83%A8_an&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E7%B6%93\n  > 上座经\n- [4] Early Buddhist · 经藏/增支部_an · an10.98 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=an10.98&lang=zh&q=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E5%A2%9E%E6%94%AF%E9%83%A8_an&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%E7%B6%93\n  > 上座经\n- [5] Early Buddhist · 经藏/相应部_sn · sn21.10 · early_buddhist — https://bayson-create.github.io/Early-Buddhist/?view=sn21.10&lang=zh&q=%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7&coll=%E7%BB%8F%E8%97%8F%2F%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E9%83%A8_sn&au=zhuang&mt=%E4%B8%8A%E5%BA%A7%EF%BC%81\n  > 上座！\n- [6] Early Buddhist · 经藏/相应部_sn · sn21.10 · ear